# Crepe recipe

## Ingredients

- 6 eggs
- 500g flour
- 1L milk

## Instructions

1. Beat the eggs
2. Add the flour bit by bit
3. Add the milk slowly, while beating the batter.
4. Mix until very smooth, and a thin uninterrupted ribbon of batter flows from the whisk when lifting it.

## Toppings 

According to taste! Marmelade, Nutella, Caramel, sugar, ...
My favourite: sugar + a squeeze of lemon juice, yummy!


## Tips

The extra preparation can be put in a container a frozen for 2-3 months.
